group features/gui
note In the Symbols tab, type in the filter field to narrow the table to symbols whose name or file path contains the text, case-insensitively; every keystroke re-filters. Each row shows + when a path covers the symbol, its name, kind and file:line. Clicking a row focuses that symbol: when it is a whole-symbol step of the path being read, that step is selected; otherwise the Listing opens on it, or, on the Path or Graph tab, the document stays and the status bar says the symbol is off the path.

